{"c":[{"id":"c3649964eaa98e3b","sum":"No SQLite writes on the gate's event path (buffer, flush on tick). Pending watch: status text and a vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; keep the trailing debounce. Background-only fixture: stdin 'focus NAME' still moves AX focus. No execFileSync in eval polls.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"e6572ec977c106ea","sum":"No SQLite writes on the pattern gate's event path (one insert stalled 11 ms at load 15-69); buffer and flush on tick. A --background-only caret-fixture reports no key window, yet stdin 'focus NAME' still moves AX focus; the reader sees leave and focus walks.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T143157Z-fc39a0364b9ecb3f","text":"Pattern gate runs on the event path: no SQLite writes there (one decision-log insert stalled 11 ms at load 15-69); decisions are buffered and flushed on tick.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160236Z-60fc41a933501ea6","text":"A --background-only (prohibited) caret-fixture reports no key window, yet stdin 'focus NAME' (makeKey + makeFirstResponder) still moves AX focus; the reader sees leave and focus walks.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"e21a3ad8c4a3fa82","sum":"Pending watch: a finished job's status text and vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; keep the trailing debounce or Jev judges a half-changed window. Eval scripts: no execFileSync in polling loops (lsappinfo every 100 ms added 150-250 ms to latencies, B4).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T160237Z-6009f034277d69a2","text":"Pending watch: a finished job's status text and its vanishing progress bar arrive in separate snapshots; without the trailing debounce the first Jev answer is about a half-changed window and is stale.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T160237Z-ba6e47628dfc0d66","text":"Eval scripts: never execFileSync in a polling loop. lsappinfo every 100 ms held the in-process helper's event loop and added 150-250 ms to every measured latency (B4).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"33f4ffb90faaf6ab","sum":"Hardware input shows only as powerd's UserIsActive in pmset -g log (B5). One window departure reaches the helper up to 3 times; count it once. Read the shadow store via sqlite3 mode=ro .backup only. Pending markers come from structure, not a sidebar 'Working' text (B6).","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6aeaadf7a5a96e75","sum":"Hardware input shows only as powerd's UserIsActive in pmset -g log (B5). The helper sees one window departure up to 3 times (appSwitch, leave walk, focus elsewhere): count per departure; a return is a focused walk of a departed window.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T173801Z-d9e0d3a584c9d36e","text":"Human activity on this Mac: only powerd's UserIsActive 'kernel.useractive' in pmset -g log marks hardware input; agents' posted events raise WindowServer per-process assertions, and WindowServer per-device ones stay raised for days (B5).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T173802Z-3bfd0ad97555af7b","text":"Helper reports one window departure up to three times (appSwitch, leave walk, focus elsewhere); count per departure, and detect a return as a focused walk of a departed window, since focusedWindowId does not change across an unreadable app.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"7e4af4b925d02c75","sum":"Read the shadow store only via sqlite3 'file:...?mode=ro' .backup to a temp copy (opening it as Store writes a salt). Agent sidebars (T3, Codex) keep a 'Working' status for a thread's life: pending markers come from structure, not status words (B6).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T173802Z-57d66219a60e6cdb","text":"Read the shadow store only through sqlite3 'file:...?mode=ro' .backup into a temp copy; opening a data dir as Store creates a salt file and chmods it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T201044Z-85ef58a913b9161a","text":"T3 Code and Codex list other agent threads in a left sidebar, each a button holding a status text ('Working') that lasts the thread's life; pending markers must come from structure (enabled stop button by the composer), not status words (B6 census).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
